                        "review": "I’m pleasantly surprised! I’ve never really tried an FMV game before, but this was a surprisingly engaging experience.\n\nThe game has 7 different endings and some genuinely different story paths. I reached my first ending in just over an hour, which felt a little short, but the experience was interesting enough that I’m definitely tempted to go back and explore the other possibilities.\n\nOverall, I found it much more engaging than most of what Netflix has to offer these days.\n\nWould I recommend it? Absolutely, if you can get it on sale. Would I personally pay full price for it? Probably not. But at a discounted price, it's well worth checking out!",
